      <div class="pane-head">
        <span class="pane-title">🥢 附近可下单</span>
        <span class="pane-sub">美团 · 闪购 实时比价</span>
        <button class="icon-btn" id="paneLocate" type="button" title="使用精确定位" aria-label="使用精确定位">◎</button>
        <button class="icon-btn" id="paneRefresh" type="button" title="刷新" aria-label="刷新">↻</button>
      </div>
      <div class="pane-status" id="paneStatus"></div>
      <div class="pane-tabs">
        <button type="button" data-pane-tab="products" class="active">团购 / 商品</button>
        <button type="button" data-pane-tab="shops">门店</button>
      </div>
      <div class="pane-list" id="paneList"></div>
      <p class="pane-foot">价格与库存以平台实时页面为准；下单与支付在美团 App / 淘宝闪购完成，本站不代收款项。</p>
    </section>

    <div class="llm-section">
      <div class="section-title-row">
        <div class="section-title">✨ 问问食神</div>
        <span class="agent-badge" id="agentBadge">glm-4.7-flash</span>
      </div>
      <div class="agent-hint" id="agentHint">食神会结合城市、口味与附近真实门店给你出签。后端未配置或限流时自动降级为本地食神。</div>
      <div class="llm-input-area">
        <input type="text" class="llm-input" id="llmInput" maxlength="300" autocomplete="off" placeholder="想吃什么？说说口味、预算或场景..." onkeydown="handleKeyDown(event)">
        <button type="button" class="llm-send-btn" id="llmSendBtn" onclick="sendLLM()">发送</button>
      </div>
      <div class="llm-thinking" id="llmThinking" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        <span id="llmThinkingText">食神正在翻签</span>
        <span class="thinking-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="llm-result" id="llmResult" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="history-section">
      <div class="section-title">📜 近日食记</div>
      <div class="history-list" id="historyList">
        <div class="history-item">
          <span class="food-name">🍜 豚骨拉面</span>
          <span class="food-time">昨天</span>
        </div>
        <div class="history-item">
          <span class="food-name">🥗 凯撒沙拉</span>
          <span class="food-time">前天</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="safe-bottom"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="immersive-overlay" id="immersiveOverlay" onclick="handleOverlayClick(event)">
  <div class="particles-container" id="particlesContainer"></div>
  <div class="glow-effect" id="glowEffect"></div>
  
  <div class="immersive-container" id="immersiveContainer">
    <div class="sign-container" style="pointer-events:none;">
      <div class="sticks-in-container">
        <div class="stick-preview"></div>
        <div class="stick-preview"></div>
        <div class="stick-preview"></div>
        <div class="stick-preview"></div>
        <div class="stick-preview"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="container-rim"></div>
      <div class="container-body">
        <div class="container-label">食运签</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rope-knot">
        <div class="rope-band"></div>
        <div class="rope-knot-center"></div>
        <div class="rope-tassel"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flying-stick" id="flyingStick">
      <div class="stick-body">
        <div class="stick-wood"></div>
        <div class="stick-tip"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stick-sealed" id="stickSealed" onclick="openStick(event)">
        <div class="sealed-text" id="sealedFortune">大吉</div>
        <div class="sealed-hint">👆 点击翻开</div>
        <div class="cloud-pattern"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stick-card" id="stickCard">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-fortune" id="cardFortune">大吉</div>
          <div class="card-number" id="cardNumber">第 八 签</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-food">
          <div class="card-food-emoji" id="cardEmoji">🍣</div>
          <div class="card-food-name" id="cardFoodName">寿司拼盘</div>
          <div class="card-food-desc" id="cardFoodDesc">新鲜的鱼肉搭配醋饭，口感丰富，今日宜品尝日式料理</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-bottom">
          <div class="card-blessing" id="cardBlessing">食运亨通，万事如意</div>
        </div>
        <!-- v0.5：签上直接给"能下单的东西"，没有平台数据时自动隐藏 -->
        <div class="card-platform" id="cardPlatform" hidden></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="close-hint" id="closeHint">点击空白处关闭</div>
</div>

